# ====================================================================
# Git Ignore for 「未来的韩语」 (Yonsei Korean Learner)
# ====================================================================

# --- 非软件源码 / 外部参考文档 ---
单词/
语法/
*.pdf
2025-05-01_14-41-35_UTC_20.jpg

# --- 二进制安装包（通过 GitHub Releases 发布）---
*.apk
*.ap_
*.aab

# --- Android / Gradle 构建产物与缓存 ---
.gradle/
**/build/
android_arch/.gradle/
android_arch/.kotlin/
android_arch/**/build/
android_arch/app/build/

# --- 本地环境配置与密钥（包含本机 SDK 路径）---
local.properties
android_arch/local.properties
*.keystore
*.jks

# --- IDE 与编辑器缓存 ---
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# --- Python 缓存 ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/

# --- 操作系统临时文件 ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
